{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"还说不清\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他一想到这个人就柔软起来，很想亲近，连自己都没料到心意来得这么快。\",\n      \"key\": \"来得这么快\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他舍不得退开，又怕显得太在意会让两人相处拘谨，靠近时便收住，自己也没想透为何要收住。\",\n      \"key\": \"相处拘谨\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他还没摸准怎样靠近才自在，眼下也不必急着决定两人以后怎样。\",\n      \"key\": \"靠近才自在\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R1\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留想到这个人便柔软、很想亲近的事实，补出他自己也没料到心意来得这么快，解释开场的突然感；不把烟花等珠子里的画面写成真实经历。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R2\", \"R3\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写并合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留舍不得退开、靠近时收住的矛盾，把原先没有具体缘由的谨慎改为担心自己显得太在意会让相处拘谨，不照搬珠子中说出口便会改变关系的表述；同时保留他知道自己在怕什么，却还没完全想透为何要收住的部分。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R3\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留眼下不必马上决定两人以后怎样的状态，但不再拿它解释他为什么谨慎。补出他还没摸准怎样靠近才自在，说明亲近仍在试探、尚未安稳，也为下一段暂不安排喜欢的去向留下前因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R4\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-2\", \"S01-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"舍不得放下已并入S01-2，不再单列重复。原先轻得仿佛随时可以放下的悖论没有独立的心理解释；其中尚未安稳的意味改由S01-3尚未摸准怎样靠近来承接，不再用漂亮的对照代替原因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0bb51cad-9db3-4495-9d43-7dc50744a826", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T163303449213Z", "elapsed_seconds": 668.344, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T16:44:11.802151+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "638c72a104d4a685865775aebc2fdba372a9a960800189ac43b4c8eae20e2f51", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T163303449213Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "964411b7d1572a76cf1c1225b1fc2ce27c71f23aca55103587c8f3e60e7745bb"}}}
